PROBLEM: Industrial Production Planning

MAXIMIZE
45 ProductA + 38 ProductB + 52 ProductC + 30 ProductD

SUBJECT TO
2 ProductA + 3 ProductB + 4 ProductC + ProductD <= 240
3 ProductA + 2 ProductB + 5 ProductC + 2 ProductD <= 300
4 ProductA + 2 ProductB + 3 ProductC + ProductD <= 260
ProductA + 3 ProductB + 2 ProductC + 4 ProductD <= 220
ProductA >= 20
ProductB >= 15